  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="f-8" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;8. Transmission, distribution, utility support, and corporate business service employees are represented by the International Brotherhood of Electrical Workers, AFL-CIO Local Union 2286. The Company and the Union agreed to a contract effective March 3, 2024 through March 3, 2029. Effective March 3, 2026, the wages had a one-time market adjustment of 1.0% with a general wage increase of 3.0%.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
